{"page":"flow","mainClass":"shell app-main","main":"<div id=\"connection-error\" class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" hidden><p id=\"connection-error-text\"></p></div><div id=\"action-message\" class=\"notice\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><div class=\"page-heading reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"status-dot\"></i> 05 / Flow · Receipt inspector</p><h1>Follow the money<br>line by line.</h1><p>A private, run-scoped ledger of what was called, what moved, and what reverted—with each receipt one click away.</p></div><div class=\"heading-aside\">Only captured hashes.<br>No unrelated chain scans.<br>No hidden cutoff.</div></div><details class=\"run-selector\" open><summary>Saved runs &amp; connection <span class=\"chevron\">+</span></summary><div class=\"run-toolbar\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"run-history\">Selected demonstration</label><select id=\"run-history\" data-run-select disabled><option>Loading saved runs…</option></select></div><div class=\"run-context\" data-run-context>Connecting…</div><button class=\"button small\" data-retry-state>Refresh state</button></div></details><div id=\"flow-error\" class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div><div id=\"flow-message\" class=\"notice warning\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><form id=\"flow-filters\" class=\"filter-panel reveal\" aria-label=\"Filter recorded transactions\"><div class=\"filter-grid\"><div class=\"field search-field\"><label for=\"flow-search\">Search receipts</label><input id=\"flow-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Hash, wallet, function, event…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-category\">Category</label><select id=\"filter-category\"><option value=\"all\">All categories</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-status\">Receipt status</label><select id=\"filter-status\"><option value=\"all\">All statuses</option><option value=\"success\">Success</option><option value=\"reverted\">Reverted</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-range\">Time range</label><select id=\"filter-range\"><option value=\"all\">All dates</option><option value=\"15m\">Last 15 min · now</option><option value=\"1h\">Last hour · now</option><option value=\"24h\">Last 24 hours · now</option><option value=\"custom\">Custom range</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-sort\">Time order</label><select id=\"filter-sort\"><option value=\"newest\">Newest first</option><option value=\"oldest\">Oldest first</option></select></div></div><div id=\"custom-range\" class=\"custom-range\" hidden><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-from\">From · local time</label><input id=\"filter-from\" type=\"datetime-local\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"filter-to\">To · local time</label><input id=\"filter-to\" type=\"datetime-local\" step=\"1\"></div></div><div class=\"filter-bottom\"><p id=\"filter-description\">All dates by default, so older runs stay visible.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"button small quiet\" data-clear-filters>Clear filters</button></div></form><div id=\"filter-error\" class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div><div class=\"split-layout\"><section class=\"reveal\"><div class=\"flow-meta\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Run-scoped receipts</p><h2>Transaction ledger</h2><p id=\"flow-count\" role=\"status\">Loading saved run state…</p></div><p id=\"flow-sort-note\">Newest first</p></div><div id=\"flow-transactions\" class=\"tx-list\" aria-label=\"Recorded transaction receipts\"><div class=\"empty-state\"><h3>Choose a run to follow the funds.</h3><p>Start the live demo or select a saved run above. Flow only reads hashes captured by that run.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/demo\">Open live demo ↗</a></div></div></div></section><aside class=\"aside-stack flow-aside\"><section class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Run snapshots</p><h2>Recorded wallets</h2></div></div><p class=\"fine-print\">Snapshots from the selected run, not live balances assigned to an old date.</p><div id=\"flow-wallets\" class=\"wallet-list\"><p class=\"snapshot-note\">Waiting for saved-run evidence.</p></div></section><section class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Scope</p><h2>What this ledger means.</h2></div><button id=\"refresh-flow\" class=\"button small\" type=\"button\" disabled><span id=\"refresh-flow-label\">Refresh receipts</span></button></div><p id=\"flow-scope\" class=\"fine-print\">Only transaction hashes captured by the selected run are eligible.</p><p id=\"flow-run-id\" class=\"mono snapshot-note\">No run selected</p><p id=\"flow-last-loaded\" class=\"snapshot-note\">No successful receipt read yet</p><p id=\"flow-refresh-note\" class=\"snapshot-note\">Active runs refresh automatically.</p><div class=\"trust-note\">A reverted call is still a real transaction and consumes gas. A held proposal is not a completed transfer.</div></section></aside></div><div id=\"connection-status\" class=\"connection-line\" data-connection=\"offline\"><span><i class=\"status-dot\"></i><span id=\"connection-label\">Connecting to saved state</span></span><span id=\"connection-age\">Waiting for server</span></div>","scripts":["/assets/experience.js","/assets/flow.js"]}